  "prefLabel": "Occ 301.03 Direct supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 301.03 “Direct supervision” means supervision through direct and continuous observation of the activities of the person being supervised and includes in-person and virtual supervision.\n\nSource. #8296, eff 3-1-05; ss by #8894, eff 6-7-07; ss by #10901, eff 7-29-15; ss by #14477, eff 3-13-26, EXPIRES: 3-13-36 (formerly Occ 301.04)",
